comments.text:
One of the other AI channels mentioned entire classes of problems o3 is rubbish for. At least one of them would be "cured" if the candidate AGI was enabled to walk around, watch how the world works in ways we do not usually think about, and develop the relatively uncommon "common sense" we expect our peers to have. o3 living with a visual model component for a modest amount of time might be able to solve another class of fairly typical (published) Mensa test questions about configurations of blocks.

On the other paw - o3 is formidable. I hope somehow it can develop a cuddly side that is not play acting of a psychopath.

{^_^}
